!
! This test calculates the energy and dipole moment
! of the water molecule at different levels of theory.
!
! WARNING : TESTING PURPOSE ONLY
! We use only LL-type integrals : results are not reliable !
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Water molecule. Restricted kinetic balance. Energies, dipole moment.
.WAVE F
.PROPER
.4INDEX
**HAMILTONIAN
.INTFLG      
1 0 0 0
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.SCF
.RELCCSD
*SCF
.EVCCNV
1.0E-8
**PROPERTIES
.DIPOLE
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
energy -1.0 2.0 0.2
*END OF

 &RELCCSD TIMING=T, DOSORT=T, DOENER=T, DOFOPR=T, DOSOPR=F &END
 &CCENER DOMP2=T, DOCCSD=T, DOCCSDT=T &END
 &CCFOPR DOMP2G=T &END

